lineimg\" />((. It will be on January the 30th</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm somewhat less friggin excited!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7165-queen-anne-country","name":"Queen Anne Country","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-22T20:29:57-08:00","id":1178325,"title":"","content":"I'm... actually a bit more excited? Given Trinity facing some hesitance due to the Kickstarter backlog, a bit more time for Wr20's WW edit inputs, and Scion to possible see a backer release draft, means more people are going to feel comfortable backing if more old KS books are at least in the printing stage instead of the editing stage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-22T22:56:59-08:00","id":1178372,"title":"","content":"Well I can't say I'm happy I suppose, but I take comfort in the fact that it seems mostly pretty well along. Also excited since, unlike scion, we still really have no idea what the aeon specific parts of the system look like.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3109-lionmanguy","name":"Lionmanguy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"167"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-23T11:30:45-08:00","id":1178493,"title":"","content":"Word from Rich in <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/pushin-through-the-cold-to-get-to-the-cake-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\">the Monday Meeting comments</a> on how they're going to be previewing the books: the text for both of them is finished, and they'll be releasing sections during the KS.<br /> <br /> (So, either like Lost 2e or Beckett's Jyhad Diary - I'm leaning to Lost 2e, myself, releasing the whole thing in stages.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-25T14:29:25-08:00","id":1179313,"title":"","content":"I won't be able to get in on the kickstarter in January. When is the kickstarter closed? How long do I have to buy in.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-25T14:40:41-08:00","id":1179314,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Astromancer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1156946-kickstarter-in-january?p=1179313#post1179313\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I won't be able to get in on the kickstarter in January. When is the kickstarter closed? How long do I have to buy in.</div> </div> </div> </div>They usually go for a month.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3109-lionmanguy","name":"Lionmanguy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"167"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-25T17:52:18-08:00","id":1179377,"title":"","content":"Well I know a lot of people in my office are interested and in the local gaming community so I'm keeping an eye out <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13091-thewanderingjewels","name":"TheWanderingJewels","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13091_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-25T20:17:36-08:00","id":1179416,"title":"","content":"Everyone in my 6 person group is chomping at the bit to go in on this kickstarter...but it wont be til the 1st of Feb, cause...ya know...Paychecks.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=392\" data-tempid=\"temp_392_1519878565794_106\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3676-manbearpig","name":"ManBearPig","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3676_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"148"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-25T20:55:40-08:00","id":1179431,"title":"","content":"Kickstarter doesn't charge you until the end of the campaign. Pledging on January 30th or February 1st shouldn't make a difference. It's more important to make sure they keep money around at the end of February.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-25T23:08:53-08:00","id":1179446,"title":"","content":"Oh, quick note: Ian confirmed you can play a quantakinetic in hiding over on RPGnet, for everyone who's wanted a chance at playing a full chib.<br /> <br /> Also, based on the Storypath previews, their power set's going to be different from the Trinity Players Guide to some extent, as their portfolio now includes probability.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-25T23:20:08-08:00","id":1179449,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>marin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1156946-kickstarter-in-january?p=1179446#post1179446\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh, quick note: Ian confirmed you can play a quantakinetic in hiding over on RPGnet, for everyone who's wanted a chance at playing a full chib.<br /> <br /> Also, based on the Storypath previews, their power set's going to be different from the Trinity Players Guide to some extent, as their portfolio now includes probability.</div> </div> </div> </div>Just going to nip this in the bud before it gathers momentum - I don't know where the rpgnet person got their rumours, or what they think hey saw in the previews, but they're wrong. Quantakinesis doesn't involve probability. (You can play a quantakinetic, though.)<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-25T23:45:04-08:00","id":1179453,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bunyip</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1156946-kickstarter-in-january?p=1179449#post1179449\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Just going to nip this in the bud before it gathers momentum - I don't know where the rpgnet person got their rumours, or what they think hey saw in the previews, but they're wrong. Quantakinesis doesn't involve probability. (You can play a quantakinetic, though.)<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>The Storypath previews describe quantakinesis as covering subtle quantum forces and probability, so... probably mistake or dropped plan.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-26T00:11:29-08:00","id":1179456,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>marin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1156946-kickstarter-in-january?p=1179453#post1179453\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The Storypath previews describe quantakinesis as covering subtle quantum forces and probability, so... probably mistake or dropped plan.</div> </div> </div> </div>&lt;Obi Wan Kenobi&gt;<br /> Quantakinesis could be seen as altering probability... from a certain point of view.<br /> &lt;/Obi Wan&gt;<br /> <br /> #cryptic<br /> <br /> I'll talk more about it when the Kickstarter starts and people have the psionic powers text to read. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"